<title>USA: First Data says selling Genex services unit.</title>
<headline>First Data says selling Genex services unit.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Data Corp said on Wednesday that Provident Companies Inc signed a definitive agreement to buy First Data's GENEX Services Inc and GENEX Services of Canada Inc.</p>
<p>The terms were not disclosed. First Data acquired GENEX as part of its 1995 merger with First Financial Management Corp.</p>
<p>GENEX was founded in 1978 as an independent firm focused on workers' compensation.</p>
<p>Provident Companies, provides disability, life and related coverages to the individual and employee benefit marketplace.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
